# Floor 2, the Torch Shrine: a zombie walks the player down.
#
# The zombie has no aggro condition and no line-of-sight check (02 §2.2) — it simply comes,
# at 7 subpx/tick, from three tiles away. The player never moves.
#
# Three tiles is inside 02 §2.1's entry-safe radius, so the near zombie is held back on entry:
# 30 ticks of telegraph and 12 of blink-in before it takes its first step. Its partner across
# the room starts at once, which is what the tick-0 count of one is. Everything after the
# 42-tick wait is the walk-down as it always was, 42 ticks later.
#
# The two hits are 63 ticks apart: the 60-tick i-frame window of 01 §5.1 plus the 3 ticks of
# hit-stop the first hit froze (01 §1 phase 2). Nothing here damages the zombie, which is the
# other half of 02 §2.1's trap immunity — the spikes that would prove it arrive with M4.

floor f2
room R4
at 5,1

assert room=R4 enemies=1 hp=6

W 42
assert enemies=2 hp=6    # blinked in, and still harmless on the tile it started on

W 87
assert hp=6              # still closing

W 1
assert hp=5              # tick 130: contact

W 62
assert hp=5              # tick 192: refused all the way through the i-frame window

W 1
assert hp=4 enemies=2 deaths=0
